bibliograph-happyview (2.17.4-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging revision 2: carry the lexicon.community PR #18 book lexicons.

    - The deploy oneshot now uploads the imported
      community.lexicon.media.book lexicons (defs, edition, searchEditions,
      resolveEditions, review) from happyview/lexicons instead of the pinned
      books-wg copies. The HappyView binary is unchanged at 2.17.4.

 -- Bibliograph Maintainers <maintainers@olamaelcu.net>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

bibliograph-happyview (2.17.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package. HappyView 2.17.4 extracted from the pinned image
    (ghcr.io/gamesgamesgamesgamesgames/happyview), running as a host service
    beside the SvelteKit application:

    - happyview.service binds 127.0.0.1:3000; the app is the public origin and
      proxies /xrpc here.
    - bibliograph-happyview-deploy.service (oneshot) bootstraps an admin key,
      uploads the lexicons, query scripts and write procedures, and applies the
      activity indexes on install.
    - db-init.sql creates the dedicated role and `happyview` schema for the
      shared-database layout.

 -- Bibliograph Maintainers <maintainers@olamaelcu.net>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0000
